CHBackgammon
Copyright 2026 bateske

From CHBlackjack (https://github.com/bateske/CHBlackjack, Apache-2.0), by way
of CHChess: the input and frame pacing (the CHGame library's chgame/Input.*),
palette, drawing, outlined lettering, effects, sound sequencer, flash saving,
debug protocol and the PC simulator and tools, adapted here; and CHChess's
pointing glove (tools/art/common/hand.png). CHBlackjack is a derivative of
"Blackjack" for the Arduboy by Press Play On Tape (Apache-2.0); the 3x5 pixel
font in the CHGame library (platform/board/arduino/CHGame/libraries/CHGame/src/chgame/Draw.cpp) is
Press Play On Tape's.

Everything else - the rules, the neural network, its trainer and the weights
it learned (src/ai/NetData.cpp, tools/train/net.bin), the match equity table
and the model it is worked out from (tools/train/met.py), the display font
(tools/art/common/font.txt), the board, the game flow and the presentation - is
new, under the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE).
